The macro is designed to simplify the process of increasing the price of an item in the Albion online game. When the lot window is open, the player can click on the macro, and the price of the item will automatically increase by 1 silver. This avoids the need to move the mouse and perform other actions, just click the button and you're done.

The Keyran program is required to use the macro. In the program, you need to make the following settings:

1. The «Window» section:
- Works without binding to the window;
   - It is not necessary to use the driver;
   - The screen resolution is 1980x1080.

2. Program Settings section:
   - Start incognito mode «ON» (required!);
   - Use the minimum delay when pressing keys in macros «ON»;
   - Respond only to physical keyboard and mouse clicks «ON»;
   - Block keystrokes of «ON» modifiers;
   - Bind to any button (it is recommended not to repeat the game keys).

Thus, after configuring the program and installing a macro on the selected button, the player can increase the lot price by 1 silver by pressing this button. This allows you to significantly speed up and simplify trading operations in the game.

