The keys Z, X, C, R and W are used in this macro to perform certain actions in the Dota 2 game: 

Z - activates the «Blink Dagger» item for instant movement over a short distance;
X - Uses the Soul Ring item to restore mana and gain temporary additional mana;
C - Uses the «Shiva's Guard» item to create an ice shock around the hero and slow down enemies;
R - activates the hero's «Rearm» ability, which restores all his abilities and items with a long recharge;
W - activates the hero's «Rockets» ability to launch missiles at enemies in a given area.

Thus, this macro allows the player to quickly and efficiently perform certain actions in the Dota 2 game.

1. This macro is intended for the hero Muerta, which was added to the game recently. I have played more than 60 games on this hero and studied his style of play. The main idea is to look for opportunities for easy kills in between cooldowns of abilities. Thanks to the macro, this is made much easier. Constantly look for targets that you can attack, as the hero Muerta is a tempo hero and can win more easily in the early stages of the game.

2. Key assignment:
- Space (space) – use the Blink ability;
- Q – use the first ability;
- W – use the second ability;
- R – use the ultimate ability;
- X – use the Black in Bar item;
- B – use the item Ethereal (to increase the damage from the ultimate ability);
- A – use the Gleipnir item (to increase the killing potential).

3. It is important to enable quick activation of abilities, since without it the macro will not work properly. Look for a target, select it with the mouse pointer, and then activate the macro. Periodically move the mouse cursor to the target you plan to kill.
4. It is worth noting that the macro may be useless on a rating from 0 to 8 (since now players with a rating of 8K are playing at the level previously played by players with a rating of 6K).
5. If you have any questions or have requests to create a macro for a certain hero, please contact me via VKontakte by id: 4elbob3k. A modified macro for the current meta for the physical Arc Warden will be available soon.

