This macro is designed to automate game actions in the Lineage 2 game using the Keyran program. It is designed to track the health level of the mob, pet and player, and also has some additional features.

Key assignment:
- F1 - switch to the next target (monster);
- 1 - selection of a drop from the ground;
- 3 - pet attack;
- 4 - character attack (if necessary, you can swap keys 3 and 4 to adjust the priority of the attack).

It is important to note that the location of the target (information about the mob) may differ depending on the settings of the game interface and screen resolution. It is recommended to stretch the target information window to the full width of the screen as much as possible for the macro to work correctly.

The 8 key performs the following actions:
- Highlights the player;
- Activates the macro for the buff.

The buff macro checks for active buffs by the buff string. If at least one buff is already active, it will not be buffed. He begins to bafat only in the absence of any active buffs.
It is important to note that this macro is a clicker, not a full-fledged bot. This means that the macro will perform only preset actions, is not capable of independent decision-making and adaptation to a changing game situation.

A unique and effective macro for the Lineage 2 game, with the ability to use in any number of additional windows:

1. Arrange the windows with the game so that the main window No. 1 is located immediately after the Start button, and the window with the healer is next to it.

2. In window #2, where the healer is located, assign the following macro to the F1 key in the Lineage 2 game:

/target &lt;the name of the main character&gt;
/assist
/delay 0
/&lt;insert the name of the healing skill here&gt;
/&lt;if necessary, you can add several lines if one application is not enough for complete healing&gt;

3. The big advantage of this macro is that you can focus on controlling the main character in window #1 by selecting the right character for treatment and applying the macro. The healer will start casting the treatment on his own as soon as his skill is activated, and you can change the target in the main window without restrictions.

4. For the macro to work optimally, you need to make the following changes to the game settings. In the «Video» section, uncheck «Reduce system load» and enable «Use GPU».

