The semi-AFK macro for the game Solo Leveling: ARISE OVERDRIVE is designed to automate the farming process and replay battles with endless loops.

For optimal functioning of the macro, a configuration test was performed.:
- Game version: Steam;
- Screen resolution: 1920x1080;
- Minimum graphical parameters.

Farming location:
- Chapter 11 – Ant Extermination Operation;
- Dungeon: Higos (event-based);
- Level: 85/10 passes.

The functionality of the macro:
- Automatic start of the next battle;
- Restart the stage after its completion;
- Continuous cycle of passage;
- Automatic transition to the next match;
- Effectively collect experience and gold without the need for constant player involvement.

Required settings:
- God Mode (immortality mode);
- Endless Overdrive;
- Unlimited Ultimate Skill Recovery;
- Unlimited waiting time to recharge skills;
- One hit, one dead;
- Acceleration x10.

Necessary requirements for the character and his skills:
- Song Chin's skills;
- Basic skill set A;
- The main (upper) skill is «Point strike» (this is a prerequisite for the correct operation of the macro, since it is designed specifically for this skill, which is available to every player).

Terms of use:
- Suitable exclusively for the PC version of the game;
- It is necessary to leave the cursor in place while the macro is running;
- Before activation, you must complete the level manually once;
- The macro is launched from the «Repeat Battle» screen;
- No need to move the mouse until the macro is finished.

Please note! 
This macro is intended for offline play only. Online use may result in the account being blocked or otherwise sanctioned.

