This macro is designed to perform L. hellsweep combos for Kazuya in the game Tekken 7. The macro will help you automate complex and fast actions, which will increase efficiency in combat.

An example of how the macro works can be viewed in the video demonstration at the link https://youtu.be/vrr9SXHkFY0 .

However, before using the macro, you need to adjust certain keys in the game to ensure that the macro works correctly:

- Assign the keys as follows:
- Up - W;
- Down - S;
- Left - A;
- Right - D;
  - 1 - Insert;
  - 4 - End;
  - 2 - Home;
  - 3 - Delete;
  - 1+2 - Page Up;
  - 3+4 - Page Down.

The macro was tested on the last patch of the game dated December 26, 2023 (5.01 patch). For the macro to work correctly, it is necessary to disable the use of minimum delay and enable the «Use driver» option. Install the driver if necessary.

If you have any problems or have any questions, you can contact the author of the macro at Discord - flkpa#4883. Also, you can contact support via the link https://keyran.net/discord .

Use this macro to your advantage and enjoy playing Tekken 7! Don't forget that Kazuya's character embodies the dark themes of the game, and his story is a key thread of the entire narrative of the Tekken series.

